# See docs/dev/web888-kiwisdr-cherry-pick-plan.md for the analysis methodology and the
# full per-commit verdict table. See cherry-picks/PROVENANCE.md for applied-patch detail.
#
# Fields: STATUS  PATCH_FILE  KIWI_COMMIT(S)  NOTES
# STATUS: applied (patch in series) | pending (planned, no file yet) | dropped (RED, documented)
#
# KiwiSDR tree lives in .tmp/repos/KiwiSDR (gitignored); hashes are reproducible anchors.
# Run scripts/refresh-cherry-picks.sh to re-check each candidate after upstream moves.

