applied   0144-kiwi-mongoose-7.14-upgrade.patch           028687cc cef6472b 4eebfb3b aeda0224 a70c1b06 bccebc9f 970b6072 c38ff40b 6b5c05b9 (feature port B.1)  FEATURE PORT (plan section B.1): wholesale adoption of Kiwi's mongoose 7.14 set replacing 5.6 — pkgs/mongoose/mongoose.{cpp,h} + mongoose_config.h (new), web/{web,web_server}.{cpp,h} from web_*_7.14 variants, web/web_util.cpp (new, compat shims mg_str_to_cstr/mg_get_header/mg_http_send_standard_headers/mg_bin2str decl); consumers: net.cpp 4-arg check_if_forwarded (rejects forwarded local/loopback, 4th param defaulted), update.cpp update_in_progress exported, misc.cpp send_msg_buf mg_ws_send, str.cpp kiwi_json_to_html + var_ctime_r, rx_server.cpp mc->query + WEBSOCKET_OP_CLOSE, rx_server_ajax.cpp ev_data + mg_http_next_multipart (both upload blocks, kiwi_asfree'd heap vname/fname), PSKReporter udp_connect/udp_send (web_connect dropped, matches Kiwi HEAD). Web-888 deltas re-applied: var_ctime_r everywhere, cache_lock/lock_holder x3, htdoc absPath, N_EXT 32 unconditional, ZynqSDR/Mongoose hdr string, init.d stop message, no mtime_obj_keep, EXT_LIST_JS, .css suffix dropped; gen_list_css/gen_list_js[0] restored to Web-888's file set/paths (Kiwi's 7.14 lists reference files absent from the RaspSDR tree — kiwi/waterfall.js, kiwi/ant_switch.js, kiwi/noise_{blank,filter}.js, pkgs/w3.css, pkgs/w3color.js, coloris.css, font-awesome-4.6.3 — so the served index page requested nonexistent resources; Web-888 loads waterfall/ant_switch/noise_* via its own extension loader); give-up NOT-FOUND path now mg_http_reply(404)+mg_connection_close (Kiwi HEAD returns MG_FALSE silently, which in mongoose 7.14 leaves the connection hanging forever with zero bytes — one missing static file stalled the whole page load in a browser; observed on hardware 2026-08-05) Collision/build fixes: mongoose.h MQTT_OK enum hidden under #ifndef KIWISDR + privately re-declared in mongoose.cpp (clashes with pkgs/mqtt-c MQTT_OK=1 via net.h transitive include; Web-888 uses LiamBindle MQTT-C, not Cesanta mg_mqtt_*); CMakeLists.txt adds pkgs/sdrpp_server to websdr.bin include dirs (0144's web_server.cpp sdrpp_server.h include exposed the pre-existing omission) + MG_ARCH=MG_ARCH_CUSTOM compile def (mongoose.h only includes mongoose_config.h when MG_ARCH is unset/CUSTOM; __unix__ pre-sets MG_ARCH=UNIX so MG_ENABLE_IPV6 was silently 0 — tousa() built an AF_INET sockaddr for an AF_INET6 socket and bind() failed EINVAL, crash-looping websdr.bin on hardware; Kiwi passes the flag globally in pkgs/mongoose/Makefile.inc). EXCLUDES 38079f38 (FSK UDP streaming feature itself — separate port). Unblocks: FSK UDP, DRM RSCI, multi-admin autokick 28b31980, proxy-header robustness

